part marek_claim
  tally 2
  note "T, M2 (issues #167, #114), DONE gate 2, G1 (engine-requirements §3.2, 8.1): lending Marek 2 000 on 2026-03-12 moved net worth that day by -40.96 if Marek is a claim (only that day's spending), by -2 040.96 if he's outside. 14-marek.json: place marek, kind claim; its ledger rows, bank rows on konto, each in a version that covers konto on its day beside the month's record. Read with the bank run (reality.tally, bank.tally, records/); net worth's change on the day is the flows of the household's places, outside places left out in writing (L §3.6, D-1). Its twin is marek_out.tally: the same rows, marek outside."

